{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#card-zh","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch（DSH 网页端插件）：管理 Agent 角色预设，并按角色策略创建子代理。它在 DSH 注册预设目录查询与派遣工具，同时提供「Agent 管理」设置页，可编辑角色、模型范围和派遣策略。主要功能包括查看可派遣预设与授权模型、以前台或后台方式派遣子代理、记录派遣状态和路由信息，以及在界面查看调用记录和子会话信息。适合需要为不同开发任务配置专门角色并将工作分派给子代理的用户。使用前需要 DSH 0.2.x 兼容运行时；模型由实例提供方和授权配置决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:43-50","host.js:225-227","core.js:307-318","core.js:398-414","client.js:728-747"]}
{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#card-en","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch (web plugin) manages agent roles and dispatches child agents under per-role policies. Its tools list presets and launch foreground or background tasks. The Agent Management page edits roles and model settings and shows dispatch history. Requires DSH 0.2.x.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:43-50","host.js:225-227","core.js:307-318","core.js:398-414","client.js:728-747"]}
