{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#feature-1","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch 的功能「预设目录」：查询当前可用的 Agent 预设及其模型和思考强度限制，默认返回可派遣目录，也可请求完整诊断信息。通过 `preset_list` 工具触发，结果供调用者选择角色。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.js:307-318","core.js:330-350"]}
{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#feature-2","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch 的功能「子代理派遣」：按指定预设创建新的子代理并提交独立任务，可选模型、推理强度和后台运行。通过 `preset_dispatch` 工具触发，前台返回任务结果，后台返回作业编号。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.js:398-414","core.js:415-434"]}
{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#feature-3","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch 的功能「角色预设管理」：在网页设置页查看、创建、编辑、复制、排序和删除本插件管理的角色定义，并设置派遣策略。用户通过 Agent 管理页面操作，设置经管理接口保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:713-747","host.js:178-179"]}
{"unit_id":"BigRagdollCat__DSH-Preset-Dispatch#feature-4","repo":"BigRagdollCat/DSH-Preset-Dispatch","commit":"7c81a5b6a18aee0bdcb5baf28361442c065c745a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Preset Dispatch 的功能「派遣记录」：记录派遣状态、角色、路由和子会话关联，并在页面查看近期调用信息。运行记录由派遣实现更新，设置页提供调用记录入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.js:448-459","client.js:737-741","host.js:225-228"]}
